{"seq":3,"slug":"lifetimes","title":"生命周期标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/lifetimes","wordCount":974,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"生命周期标注\">生命周期标注</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生命周期（Lifetime）描述引用保持有效的作用域范围，是借用检查器判断&quot;引用是否会悬垂&quot;的依据。它<strong>不是</strong>让引用活得更久的机制，恰恰相反：标注是在向编译器<strong>声明输入与输出引用之间的依赖关系</strong>，从而把&quot;返回值不能比数据源活得更久&quot;这类约束写进类型签名。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>标注即约束</strong>：<code>&#39;a</code> 表达的是&quot;这些引用至少存活到 <code>&#39;a</code>&quot;这一相对关系，而非某个绝对时间长度。</li>\n<li><strong>省略规则</strong>：绝大多数函数无需显式标注，编译器按三条省略规则自动推导。</li>\n<li><strong><code>&#39;static</code> 的双重含义</strong>：既表示&quot;存活整个程序&quot;，也可作为类型约束表示&quot;内部不含短生命周期引用&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"什么是生命周期\">什么是生命周期</h2><p>生命周期（Lifetime）是引用保持有效的作用域范围。Rust 编译器通过生命周期分析确保<strong>所有引用在使用时都指向有效数据</strong>，从根本上杜绝悬垂引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let r;&#10;    {&#10;        let x = 5;&#10;        r = &amp;x;&#10;    } // x 在此被释放&#10;    // println!(&quot;{}&quot;, r); // 编译错误：r 指向的数据已失效&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let x = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        r = &#x26;x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } // x 在此被释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // println!(\"{}\", r); // 编译错误：r 指向的数据已失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"函数中的生命周期标注\">函数中的生命周期标注</h2><p>当函数返回引用时，编译器需要知道返回的引用与哪个输入参数的生命周期关联。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn longest&lt;&#39;a&gt;(x: &amp;&#39;a str, y: &amp;&#39;a str) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a str {&#10;    if x.len() &gt; y.len() { x } else { y }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s1 = String::from(&quot;long string&quot;);&#10;    let result;&#10;    {&#10;        let s2 = String::from(&quot;xyz&quot;);&#10;        result = longest(s1.as_str(), s2.as_str());&#10;        println!(&quot;更长的字符串: {}&quot;, result);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn longest&#x3C;'a>(x: &#x26;'a str, y: &#x26;'a str) -> &#x26;'a str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if x.len() > y.len() { x } else { y }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s1 = String::from(\"long string\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let s2 = String::from(\"xyz\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result = longest(s1.as_str(), s2.as_str());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"更长的字符串: {}\", result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&#39;a</code> 的含义：返回值的生命周期等于 <code>x</code> 和 <code>y</code> 中<strong>较短</strong>的那个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;&#39;a: x 的生命周期&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;&#39;a: 取交集&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;&#39;a: y 的生命周期&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;返回值的生命周期 ≤ min(x, y)&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"'a: x 的生命周期\"] --&gt; C[\"'a: 取交集\"]\n    B[\"'a: y 的生命周期\"] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[\"返回值的生命周期 ≤ min(x, y)\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期省略规则\">生命周期省略规则</h2><p>大多数情况下不需要显式标注生命周期，编译器会自动推导。这称为<strong>生命周期省略规则</strong>（Lifetime Elision Rules）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则一</td>\n<td>每个引用参数获得独立的生命周期</td>\n<td><code>fn foo(x: &amp;str, y: &amp;str)</code> → <code>fn foo&lt;&#39;a, &#39;b&gt;(x: &amp;&#39;a str, y: &amp;&#39;b str)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则二</td>\n<td>若只有一个输入生命周期，输出生命周期与之相同</td>\n<td><code>fn foo(x: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str</code> → <code>fn foo&lt;&#39;a&gt;(x: &amp;&#39;a str) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a str</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则三</td>\n<td>方法中若有 <code>&amp;self</code>/<code>&amp;mut self</code>，输出生命周期与 <code>self</code> 相同</td>\n<td><code>fn get(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;str</code> 自动推导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn first_word(s: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;    &amp;s[..s.find(&#39; &#39;).unwrap_or(s.len())]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn first_word(s: &#x26;str) -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x26;s[..s.find(' ').unwrap_or(s.len())]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构体中的生命周期\">结构体中的生命周期</h2><p>结构体持有引用时必须标注生命周期，确保结构体不会比引用的数据活得更久。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"struct Excerpt&lt;&#39;a&gt; {&#10;    text: &amp;&#39;a str,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;&#39;a&gt; Excerpt&lt;&#39;a&gt; {&#10;    fn level(&amp;self) -&gt; i32 {&#10;        3&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn announce(&amp;self, announcement: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;        println!(&quot;请注意: {}&quot;, announcement);&#10;        self.text&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let novel = String::from(&quot;在很久很久以前。有一个勇敢的骑士...&quot;);&#10;    let first_sentence = novel.split(&#39;。&#39;).next().unwrap();&#10;    let excerpt = Excerpt { text: first_sentence };&#10;    println!(&quot;摘录: {}&quot;, excerpt.text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct Excerpt&#x3C;'a> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text: &#x26;'a str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;'a> Excerpt&#x3C;'a> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn level(&#x26;self) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn announce(&#x26;self, announcement: &#x26;str) -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"请注意: {}\", announcement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let novel = String::from(\"在很久很久以前。有一个勇敢的骑士...\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let first_sentence = novel.split('。').next().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let excerpt = Excerpt { text: first_sentence };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"摘录: {}\", excerpt.text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多个生命周期参数\">多个生命周期参数</h2><p>当输入引用有不同的生命周期需求时，需要多个生命周期参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn select_first&lt;&#39;a, &#39;b&gt;(first: &amp;&#39;a str, _second: &amp;&#39;b str) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a str {&#10;    first&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let s1 = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;    let result;&#10;    {&#10;        let s2 = String::from(&quot;world&quot;);&#10;        result = select_first(&amp;s1, &amp;s2);&#10;    } // s2 被释放，但 result 只依赖 s1，仍然有效&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, result);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn select_first&#x3C;'a, 'b>(first: &#x26;'a str, _second: &#x26;'b str) -> &#x26;'a str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    first</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let s1 = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let s2 = String::from(\"world\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result = select_first(&#x26;s1, &#x26;s2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } // s2 被释放，但 result 只依赖 s1，仍然有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"静态生命周期\">静态生命周期</h2><p><code>&#39;static</code> 表示引用在<strong>整个程序运行期间</strong>有效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"let s: &amp;&#39;static str = &quot;我是字符串字面量&quot;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let s: &#x26;'static str = \"我是字符串字面量\";</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否 <code>&#39;static</code></th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符串字面量 <code>&quot;hello&quot;</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>编译进二进制，存活整个程序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Box::leak(box_val)</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>手动泄漏为静态引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥有者类型 <code>T: &#39;static</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>类型不包含非静态引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般借用 <code>&amp;x</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>受变量作用域限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提醒</strong>：<code>T: &#39;static</code> 约束的含义是&quot;T 类型内部不包含短生命周期引用&quot;，而不是&quot;T 必须永远存活&quot;。<code>String</code> 就满足 <code>&#39;static</code> 约束。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期约束与-trait-bound\">生命周期约束与 Trait Bound</h2><p>生命周期可以像泛型一样参与约束表达。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fmt::Display;&#10;&#10;fn longest_with_announcement&lt;&#39;a, T&gt;(&#10;    x: &amp;&#39;a str,&#10;    y: &amp;&#39;a str,&#10;    ann: T,&#10;) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a str&#10;where&#10;    T: Display,&#10;{&#10;    println!(&quot;公告: {}&quot;, ann);&#10;    if x.len() &gt; y.len() { x } else { y }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fmt::Display;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn longest_with_announcement&#x3C;'a, T>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x: &#x26;'a str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y: &#x26;'a str,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ann: T,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) -> &#x26;'a str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    T: Display,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"公告: {}\", ann);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if x.len() > y.len() { x } else { y }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见生命周期模式速查\">常见生命周期模式速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>签名</th>\n<th>省略规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单输入单输出</td>\n<td><code>fn f(s: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str</code></td>\n<td>自动推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多输入单输出</td>\n<td><code>fn f&lt;&#39;a&gt;(x: &amp;&#39;a str, y: &amp;&#39;a str) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a str</code></td>\n<td>需要手动标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法返回 self 字段</td>\n<td><code>fn f(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;str</code></td>\n<td>规则三自动推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构体持有引用</td>\n<td><code>struct S&lt;&#39;a&gt; { field: &amp;&#39;a str }</code></td>\n<td>必须标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态数据</td>\n<td><code>fn f() -&gt; &amp;&#39;static str</code></td>\n<td>使用 <code>&#39;static</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期常见编译错误\">生命周期常见编译错误</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 错误示例：返回局部变量的引用&#10;// fn bad_ref() -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;//     let s = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;//     s.as_str() // 编译错误：s 在函数结束时被释放&#10;// }&#10;&#10;fn good_owned() -&gt; String {&#10;    String::from(&quot;hello&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误示例：返回局部变量的引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fn bad_ref() -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     let s = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     s.as_str() // 编译错误：s 在函数结束时被释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn good_owned() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    String::from(\"hello\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误场景</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>返回局部变量引用</td>\n<td>返回拥有者类型（如 <code>String</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构体引用悬垂</td>\n<td>改用 <code>String</code> 代替 <code>&amp;str</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期冲突</td>\n<td>使用 <code>clone()</code> 创建独立数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭包捕获引用</td>\n<td>使用 <code>move</code> 闭包转移所有权</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生命周期是引用有效范围的类型级描述，用于在编译期排除悬垂引用。</li>\n<li>函数返回引用时需要标注，<code>&#39;a</code> 通常取所有输入生命周期中<strong>较短</strong>的那个。</li>\n<li>三条省略规则覆盖了绝大多数场景：每参数独立、单输入即输出、<code>&amp;self</code> 决定输出。</li>\n<li>结构体持有引用必须标注；<code>T: &#39;static</code> 只意味着&quot;内部无短生命周期引用&quot;。</li>\n<li>遇到生命周期报错时，优先考虑返回拥有者类型或使用 <code>move</code> 闭包，而非强行堆叠标注。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生命周期标注","id":"生命周期标注"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是生命周期","id":"什么是生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"函数中的生命周期标注","id":"函数中的生命周期标注"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期省略规则","id":"生命周期省略规则"},{"level":2,"text":"结构体中的生命周期","id":"结构体中的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"多个生命周期参数","id":"多个生命周期参数"},{"level":2,"text":"静态生命周期","id":"静态生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期约束与 Trait Bound","id":"生命周期约束与-trait-bound"},{"level":2,"text":"常见生命周期模式速查","id":"常见生命周期模式速查"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期常见编译错误","id":"生命周期常见编译错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"引用与借用规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/references-and-borrowing"},"next":{"title":"智能指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/smart-pointers"}}